# Frontend Conventions

- Search `frontend/` (and app component dirs) before creating UI primitives
- Reuse buttons, forms, cards, modals, navbar, dashboard patterns
- Every interactive view needs loading, error, and empty states
- Prefer composition over one-off styled duplicates
- Keep client/server boundaries clear (no secrets in client bundles)
- Accessible defaults: labels, focus, keyboard, contrast
- Responsive: mobile-first; do not ship desktop-only demos without checking narrow viewports
- Animations: purposeful, subtle; never block core interaction

See `docs/conventions/frontend.md` and `docs/conventions/ui-ux.md`
